      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You know you can just collapse the comfort section if you don't wanna see / use it right?\nHaving the comfort section in the QM makes sense tbh. Before you couldn't really just switch to a different mode when you feel like you are getting a bit motion sick for example. Now you can just switch easily between the mods when you feel like you need / want a different one.\nMy idea was to move the \"Comfort Turning\" and \"Personal Space\" option there as well, there is still enough space for it next to the Movement options and you could technically just remove these from the Main Menu.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1166-add-more-comfort-options-to-the-qm",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
