  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I get that development on the old Main Menu is not the plan. However, the QM settings tab is getting a bit crowded, and (in my opinion) should be reserved only for settings you change on a regular basis. Most people don't change locomotion settings very often - so I'd propose either \nA) Move the locomotion/comfort settings into the old Main Menu (see concept pic). Re-use the current widget that's in the QM in the new Main Menu when it comes out. \nB) Keep the movement settings in the Quick Menu for now, move them into the new Main Menu when it's released\nC) Remove tunneling entirely  until the new Main Menu is released, where it will be added.",
